====== ALLNET ALL0239-3g ======

{{section>meta:infobox:432_warning#infobox_for_dataentries&noheader&nofooter&noeditbutton}}

The device comes preinstalled with an unknown Linux-distribution. You may log in with telnet @ 192.168.1.1 (default config) to get a busybox-shell. It seems that the device is a clone of Aztech HW5503g (power supply is labeled "Aztech" and the hardware specs and WebUI are the same except for the branding) but you won't mess up your installation flashing the device using the WebUI (in my case, so be careful, I won't take any responsibility for bricked devices!).


